<!-- =========================
  HERO: Advertorial
  Equal-width columns
  No shape, no image cropping
========================= -->
<section class="lt-advhero">
  <div class="lt-advhero__wrap">
    <div class="lt-advhero__grid">

      <!-- LEFT: Image -->
      <div class="lt-advhero__media-card">
        <img
          class="lt-advhero__img"
          src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/5542/9998/files/Frame_74_11fd2a7c-891e-4e8a-89c9-361300898aa2.png?v=1765928117"
          alt="Muzzle Sleep vs Melatonin"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- RIGHT: Title + CTA -->
      <div class="lt-advhero__content">
        <h1 class="lt-advhero__title">
          Muzzle Sleep VS.<br>
          Melatonin
        </h1>

        <a class="lt-advhero__cta" href="https://muzzlesleep.com/">
          <span class="lt-advhero__cta-text">Better Sleep Starts Now</span>
          <span class="lt-advhero__cta-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- =========================================================
  REST OF PAGE (under the hero)
  Left: all content (text + images + bullets)
  Right: sticky card
  Max width: 1200px
  Responsive: stack on <= 990px + sticky off
========================================================= -->
<section class="lt-advbody">
  <div class="lt-advbody__wrap">
    <div class="lt-advbody__grid">

      <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->
      <div class="lt-advbody__left">

        <!-- Block 1 -->
        <div class="lt-advbody__block">
          <h2 class="lt-advbody__h2">
            Did You Know Melatonin is Not The First<br>
            Thing Most Sleep Specialists Address?
          </h2>

          <div class="lt-advbody__rte">
            <p>Millions of adults reach for melatonin hoping for better rest, yet what often matters more is not what you take at night but how you breathe while you sleep.</p>

            <p>If your mouth falls open while you’re sleeping, no supplement can fully compensate for what happens next. You may wake up with dryness, tension, or an unsettled feeling despite doing everything “right.” That’s because nighttime behavior matters just as much as what’s in your routine.</p>

            <p>Rather than relying solely on supplements, many adults are discovering that sleep quality tends to improve when nighttime breathing habits are gently supported. And while there are complex devices made for this, most are too invasive, uncomfortable, or disruptive to use consistently.</p>

            <p class="lt-advbody__em">
              <strong><em>What if there was a minimalist way to upgrade your breathing rhythm overnight without changing how you sleep or adding gear to your face?</em></strong>
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="lt-advbody__media-card">
            <img
              class="lt-advbody__img"
              src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/5542/9998/files/content-1962267_1.png?v=1765928864"
              alt="Person sleeping comfortably"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="lt-advbody__rte lt-advbody__rte--below">
            <p>Instead of relying purely on melatonin or elaborate routines, <strong>Muzzle Sleep</strong> is designed to naturally support a habit most people don’t realize has such an impact: <strong>staying comfortably closed-mouthed while you sleep</strong>.</p>

            <p>No machines. No straps. No complicated setup. Just one comfortable adhesive strip made with ultra-safe materials, designed specifically for adults.</p>

            <p>Apply it as part of your evening, and sleep the way you normally would.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Block 2 -->
        <div class="lt-advbody__block lt-advbody__block--spaced">
          <h2 class="lt-advbody__h2">
            Why This Matters (And Why So Many<br>
            Adults are Permanently Switching)
          </h2>

          <div class="lt-advbody__media-card">
            <img
              class="lt-advbody__img"
              src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/5542/9998/files/content-1960348_1.png?v=1765928939"
              alt="Customer holding Muzzle Sleep product"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>

          <ul class="lt-advbody__bullets">
            <li class="lt-advbody__bullet">
              <span class="lt-advbody__bico" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Melatonin affects timing, not behavior.</strong></span>
            </li>
            <li class="lt-advbody__bullet">
              <span class="lt-advbody__bico" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
              <span><strong>How you sleep</strong> directly influences how rested you feel.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="lt-advbody__bullet">
              <span class="lt-advbody__bico" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
              <span>Comfortable micro-changes in nighttime habits often lead to greater consistency than big interventions.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="lt-advbody__bullet">
              <span class="lt-advbody__bico" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
              <span>And consistency is what most people are missing in their sleep routine.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- RIGHT COLUMN (Sticky Card) -->
      <aside class="lt-advbody__right">
        <div class="lt-stickycard">
          <div class="lt-stickycard__media">
            <img
              class="lt-stickycard__img"
              src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/5542/9998/files/Frame_34.png?v=1765923324"
              alt="Muzzle Sleep products"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="lt-stickycard__body">
            <h3 class="lt-stickycard__title">Join Thousands Sleeping Better Tonight</h3>
            <p class="lt-stickycard__text">
              Experience the gentle, effective solution for peaceful sleep with Muzzle Sleep Strips.
            </p>

            <a class="lt-stickycard__btn" href="https://muzzlesleep.com/">
              <span class="lt-stickycard__btn-text">Get Better Sleep Tonight</span>
              <span class="lt-stickycard__btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .lt-advbody{
    padding: 20px 16px 54px;
    background:#ffffff;
  }

  .lt-advbody__wrap{
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .lt-advbody__grid{
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 360px;
    gap: 44px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  /* Left blocks */
  .lt-advbody__block{ margin: 0; }
  .lt-advbody__block--spaced{ margin-top: 44px; }

  .lt-advbody__h2{
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    font-size: 36px;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-weight: 800;
    color:#0b0b12;
  }

  .lt-advbody__rte{
    color:#2a2a34;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 820px;
  }

  .lt-advbody__rte p{ margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .lt-advbody__rte p:last-child{ margin-bottom: 0; }

  .lt-advbody__rte strong{ font-weight: 800; color:#0b0b12; }
  .lt-advbody__rte em{ font-style: italic; }

  .lt-advbody__em{
    margin-top: 8px;
    color:#0b0b12;
  }

  /* Media cards */
  .lt-advbody__media-card{
    margin-top: 18px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(15,16,32,.10);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 48px rgba(12,12,25,.10);
    background:#ffffff;
  }

  /* These images can be cropped a bit like the design (but not required).
     If you want zero cropping, remove object-fit and height rules below. */
  .lt-advbody__img{
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .lt-advbody__rte--below{ margin-top: 16px; }

  /* Bullets */
  .lt-advbody__bullets{
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    max-width: 860px;
  }

  .lt-advbody__bullet{
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 18px 1fr;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: start;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color:#2a2a34;
  }

  .lt-advbody__bico{
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(23, 147, 229, .14);
    color: #1793e5;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  /* Sticky card (same pattern as your other advertorial page) */
  .lt-advbody__right{ position: relative; }

  .lt-stickycard{
    position: sticky;
    top: 24px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(15,16,32,.08);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(12,12,25,.12);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .lt-stickycard__media{
    background: #2a255f;
    padding: 18px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
  }

  .lt-stickycard__img{
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .lt-stickycard__body{
    padding: 18px 18px 16px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .lt-stickycard__title{
    margin: 2px 0 8px;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #1a1546;
  }

  .lt-stickycard__text{
    margin: 0 auto 14px;
    max-width: 280px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #5a5a67;
  }

  .lt-stickycard__btn{
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #1a1546;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(10,10,24,.16);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
    transition: transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease, filter .15s ease;
  }

  .lt-stickycard__btn:hover{
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(10,10,24,.20);
    filter: brightness(1.03);
  }
  .lt-stickycard__btn:active{ transform: translateY(0); }

  .lt-stickycard__btn-arrow{
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  aside.lt-long__right {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
  }
  .lt-long__grid{
    position: relative;
  }
  aside.lt-advbody__right {
    position: sticky;
    top: 50px;
}
.lt-advbody__grid {
    position: relative;
}

  /* Responsive pattern (same as your pages) */
  @media (max-width: 990px){
    .lt-advbody{
      padding: 12px 16px 40px;
    }

    .lt-advbody__grid{
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .lt-stickycard{
      position: static; /* sticky off on mobile */
    }

    .lt-advbody__h2{
      font-size: 30px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px){
    .lt-advbody__h2{
      font-size: 28px;
    }
    aside.lt-advbody__right {
        position: static;
        top: 0;
    }
  }
</style>


<style>
